@*
    Dashboard/UserIndex.cshtml
    User dashboard showing personal income and expenditure summaries with Chart.js visualisations.
    The model (UserIndexOutputViewModel) carries yearly and year-month aggregated totals
    broken down by MainClass / SubClass category.
    A year selector and month selector POST back to reload the view with the chosen period.
    Each category section renders a pie/doughnut chart and a detail table using the pre-computed
    Amount and Percentage properties from the model.
*@
